{"title":"User：Anabel.disher/en-gb","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>I cannot edit my user page anymore due to the restrictions imposed pretty recently, so I'm creating a page here.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"About_Me\">About Me</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User%EF%BC%9AAnabel.disher/en-gb&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: About Me\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Editor for the AoPS wiki</li>\n<li>Favourite colours: blue and grey</li>\n<li>I work on editing pages about mathematics contests such as CEMC, high school mathematics contests, and more. Additionally, I have edited some pages about units and mathematical problems or puzzles.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Examples_of_My_Pages\">Examples of My Pages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User%EF%BC%9AAnabel.disher/en-gb&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Examples of My Pages\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a> (18 April 2025)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours\" title=\"Four Fours\">Four Fours</a> (19 July 2026)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_BmMT_Individual_Problems\" title=\"2019 BmMT Individual Problems\">2019 BmMT Individual Problems</a> (30 September 2026)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 17\">2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 17</a> (6 October 2026)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018113346\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nCom